{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Sports and Leisure", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Bungee Jumping", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe detailed facts about events or actions in work and social contexts, in written or spoken situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le02ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Adverbial Clause of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " An <span class=\"strong\">adverbial clause</span> is a group of words which have the same function as an adverb. Like all clauses, an <span class=\"strong\">adverbial clause </span>has a subject and a verb.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Adverbial clauses </span>of manner are used to express how something happens. An adverb of manner often starts with a subordinating conjunction like <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">as</span></span>,<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\"> like</span> </span> or <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">the way</span> </span> ...  to introduce the adverbial clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:</br><span class=\"italic\"> Bungee jumpers still jump from cliffs<span class=\"strong\">  the way the original creators of the sport had intended. </span></br>They see danger <span class=\"strong\"> as an unnecessary feeling that gets in the way of enjoying the jump into the void.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Bungee jumping is an exhilarating sport which involves leaping from a high place like a tower or a bridge. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They still jump from cliffs just as the original creators of the sport intended.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Passive of Modal Verbs in the Present and Past", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the<span class=\"strong\"> passive form of Modal verbs</span> to put the emphasis on the receiver of the action, and to suggest possibility, certainty, injunction or prohibition.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "As with other verbs, the <span class=\"strong\"> passive form of modal verbs </span>puts the emphasis on the receiver of the action and not on the doer of the action. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Passive modal </span>forms are often impersonal and do not require an object. </br>Example: <ul><span class=\"italic\"><li>Bungee jumping <span class=\"strong\"> should be enjoyed </span>in a safe and responsible environment.</li> <li> Some of the best jumps in the world <span class=\"strong\"> may be enjoyed</span> from these cliffs.</li>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">The Simple Present Passive  </span><br>The structure of <span class=\"strong\">Simple Present passive</span> for modal verbs is:</br>subject+modal verb+be+past participle of verb </br></br> You can use <span class=\"strong\">Simple Present modal verbs </span>to convey a general obligation or permission.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">The Simple Past Passive  </span><br>The structure of <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past passive  </span>for modal verbs is: </br> subject+modal verb+have been+past participle of verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: </br><span class=\"italic\">Bungee jumping<span class=\"strong\"> must have been seen</span> as a rite of passage.</br> Bungee jumping<span class=\"strong\"> might have been introduced</span> to the western world by Captain James Cook, though no one is really sure about that historical fact. </span></br>You can use Simple Past modal verbs to convey certainty, possibility, or uncertainty about a past event or situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To this day, some of the best jumps in the world may be enjoyed from these cliffs.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This may have been caused by increased accessibility.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "exhilarating", "type": "name"}, {"content": "causing a feeling of excitement", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Bungee jumping is an exhilarating sport.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le02ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about extreme activities.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "elastic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that can stretch and then return to it's original size", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It involves tying strong elastic cords to one's ankles and leaping from a high place like a tower or a bridge.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le02ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to leap", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to jump very far", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You will need to leap from the plane to survive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le02ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gratifying", "type": "name"}, {"content": "satisfying or pleasing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: After the jump, there was a gratifying celebration.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le02ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "satisfied", "type": "name"}, {"content": "contented or pleased", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Satisfied parents would look on with pride.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le02ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "glorified", "type": "name"}, {"content": "important or honored", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Their sons were glorified by the village.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le02ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "thrilling", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very exciting or exhilarating", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Nowadays those looking for a more thrilling challenge also jump from special towers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le02ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "unsettling", "type": "name"}, {"content": "disturbing; makes you feel worried", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  A free fall from that height must be quite an unsettling feeling!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le02ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research an extreme activity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what must or should be done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what mustn't or shouldn't be done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my rules and regulations with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Research the equipment and procedures needed for an extreme sport like bungee jumping.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of five things that must, can or should be done while bungee jumping.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of five things that mustn't, can't or shouldn't be done while bungee jumping.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your list with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about sports and leisure time. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about how something is done. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express true, untrue and possible events in the present and past. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Would you ever try bungee jumping? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What's the greatest height you have ever jumped from?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "The history of bungee jumping!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " The leap from <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">boyhood</span> to <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_1\">manhood</span>.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback